msgstr "(50) I<env_start> \\ %lu \\ (depuis Linux 3.5) \\ [PT]"

#.  commit 5b172087f99189416d5f47fd7ab5e6fb762a9ba3
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
